# The corpus-2 regression baseline is the gate's reference point; a run can
# only mean something if the expected verdicts are in the tree.
!api/tests/corpus2_baseline.json
# The rotation manifest and the local class-to-rule mapping are inputs the test
# suite reads, not build output. `*.json` above silently dropped both from the
# first commit that added them: the manifest gate failed in CI, and the mapping
# would have made the corpus regression fail against its own baseline.
!api/tests/rotation/manifest.json
!api/tests/corpus2_mapping_local.json
